1
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:10,000
The world remembers everything…
Even what it was meant to forget.

2
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:17,500
The First Blacksmith wanted to keep every soul.
Every echo. Every pain.

3
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:25,500
But memory rots.
Memories become monsters.
And the world… begins to forget.

4
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:32,500
You are the Awakened.
You have no name. No past.
Only an empty blade…
and the memories of others.

5
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:37,000
Absorb. Or forget.
